# DTF tier manifest: isolation
# Profile-set: s3 / single. A real shared object store (MinIO) — the only
# topology on which the #2504 cross-tenant read+write and #2574/#2584 row-less
# Maven flat-key classes can manifest.
# Oracle: the fail-closed prove.sh A-F cross-tenant gate (vendored, patched).
#
# RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=false: the oracle drives many admin+alice logins and Maven
# PUTs back-to-back through a single admin; the base default (ON) would throttle
# them. Matches the proof rig's compose.s3.yml. (The base default stays ON; a
# tier that must disable a shipped control does so explicitly, per design §2.2.)
PROFILES="storage.s3"
ORACLE="oracle.sh"
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED="false"
